				""
				"-Ritual of the Untamed Wind / Mote of Air: This ritual must be executed very high."
				""
				"-Ritual of the Endless Void / Mote of Ender: 此仪式必须在完全黑暗的环境中进行。"
				""
				"-Ritual of the Searing Inferno / Mote of Fire: 需要在下界中执行。"
				""
				"-Ritual of the Deep Ocean / Mote of Water: 需要放置在海洋生物群系中。"
				""
